            <scopecontent id="aspace_3a71a52420dfb234e5de921b8358037b">
               <head>Scope and Contents</head>
               <p>The correspondence series charts Britton's work as an author and as an advocate for the creation of a support network for antiquities in the first half of the 19th century.  The latter is especially present in his correspondence with Member of Parliment Joseph Hume, a confidant and supporter of Britton's goals.</p>
            </scopecontent>
